111,114,109,97,110,99,101,32,98,117,116,32,112,114,111,100,117,99,101,115,32,116,101,97,114,105,110,103,32,97,115,32,99,111,110,115,101,113,117,101,110,99,101,46,10,10,85,78,83,69,84,32,45,32,76,101,116,32,116,104,101,32,103,97,109,101,32,100,101,99,105,100,101],"value":"ON -  Synchronize the frame rate of the game with the monitor refresh rate (60Hz) \nfor better stability and avoid tearing.\n\nADAPTIVE - Turns V-sync off if you fail to reach your refresh rate, so tearing will occur \nat that point.\n\nMAILBOX - mailbox renders the game without a FPS limit but only sends the images \nto the monitor according to the refresh rate. It provides low latency with high power \nconsumption, but provides low latency and tearing free.\n\nOFF - Do not synchronize frame rate and refresh rate, gives better \nperformance but produces tearing as consequence.\n\nUNSET - Let the game decide"},
